179:Exercise all three real transports on all transactional databases. Cover a slow Activate request, idle subscriptions, disconnect and cancellation during activation, entity and event subscriptions, and late query responses. Subscribe and immediately send a command without adding a delay to the application code. Preserve the best-effort notification contract unless a stronger guarantee is explicitly designed.
