build-protocol/tasks/sql-delivery-reliability/IMPLEMENTATION.md:71:Scoped TypeScript build exited 0 before the trace window (`storage-local-build-before-trace.log`), and touched-file ESLint exited 0 (`storage-local-lint-2.log`). Cleanup enforcement and TSDoc enforcement passed after the latest source correction (`storage-freeze-{cleanup,tsdoc}-2.log`); `git diff --check` passed. MySQL's unused connection-binding/locking helper was removed with its obsolete test, and SQL factory/helper comments now describe independent record work. The consolidated frozen-slice preflight must rerun broad typecheck, format, copyright, and changed-path branch coverage. The eventual release threshold and full real-process matrix remain open. Event presence alone cannot establish a completed Entity save; current-state writes can interleave, and a caller retry must reuse captured input. The later delivery/publication and subscription slices remain separate.
